# Internal planning and review docs, kept locally by the maintainer only --
# see docs/design-decisions.md for the public-facing distillation of these.
#
# Deliberately NOT path-anchored. These were once written as
# /docs/<name>.md, which matches only the repo-root copy: a copy of one of
# them anywhere else (docs/verification-5.0.0/SPEC-REFACTOR-HANDOFF.md, which
# is exactly what happened and reached a public remote) sailed straight past
# the rule. Matching by basename means any copy, at any depth, is ignored.
cdif-audit-and-refactoring-plan.md
direct-peer-channels-design.md
PRE-RELEASE-AUDIT.md
SPEC-REFACTOR-HANDOFF.md
